  <DisplayName>k__BackingField: Block Party
  <Description>k__BackingField: Toy-brick walls slide across the platform. Stand
    in a gap or jump the low bricks!
  <PreviewImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c26c06eda57f5774a85ffddb7606fc45, type: 3}
  <Rules>k__BackingField:
  - Stand in a gap as the wall passes
  - Jump the low bricks
  - Walls get faster and come from more sides
  <Objective>k__BackingField: Stay on the platform.
  <Danger>k__BackingField: Tall bricks shove you along until you go over the edge.
  <Scoring>k__BackingField: Last one standing wins; survivors tie at the bell.
